Code to dockerize simple wind power model for upload to DAFNI platform (https://www.dafni.ac.uk/),
and jupyter notebook to analyse the input-output samples generated on DAFNI via the parameter sweep functionality.
The ultimate goal is to quantify the uncertainty and sensitivity of model outputs. 
See model_definition.yaml for more details on the model, 
and the jupyter notebook for more details on the uncertainty and sensitivity analysis.
NOTE: the code requires two additional datasets to run: ERA5_windspeed_data (a collection of netcdf files) 
and offshore_normalised_power_curves (csv file), these are available on DAFNI)
